          "As I’ve said, “People tend to put things into silos, which is not true. Everything communicates to your consumer.” This principle doesn’t just apply to customer relationships—it’s also about how you view your team, resources, and market. A leadership coach helps break down these silos, enabling you to see opportunities that align with your business goals.",
