          "Internal barriers—like rigid processes or siloed departments—can hinder innovation. A leadership coach helps you identify and dismantle these obstacles, creating an environment where untapped opportunities can flourish.",
          "Reed Hastings, co-founder and former CEO of Netflix, has emphasized the importance of mentorship and coaching in his leadership development. Early in his career, while working at Adaptive Technology, he collaborated with CEO Audrey MacLean, from whom he learned the value of focus and prioritization. Hastings stated, \"From her, I learned the value of focus. I learned it is better to do one product well than two products in a mediocre way\" (Source: Stanford Graduate School of Business).",
          "This mentorship influenced Hastings' strategic decisions at Netflix, including the pivotal shift from DVD rentals to streaming. His foresight and adaptability in embracing streaming technology ahead of market trends secured Netflix's first-mover advantage in the entertainment industry (Source: Quartr)",
