          "Experiment and Iterate: Don’t be afraid to test new ideas, even on a small scale. Experimentation often reveals opportunities that weren’t obvious before.",
          "A leadership coach doesn’t just help you find opportunities—they help you act on them. By providing clarity, accountability, and actionable strategies, a coach ensures that untapped potential is transformed into measurable success.",
